WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,490 --> 00:00:06,490
Li Mo

2
00:00:06,490 --> 00:00:08,490
Teacher Hu said that if you ask the truth, you may be seriously injured.

3
00:00:08,490 --> 00:00:12,600
Do you think it’s true or false?

4
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:15,590
Anyone can die

5
00:00:15,590 --> 00:00:19,680
So you better take this training seriously

6
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:24,680
Don't scare me

7
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:26,680
I'll go purchase field equipment right away

8
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:28,680
Wait for me. I'll leave now.

9
00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:32,340
Won't you go?

10
00:00:32,340 --> 00:00:33,340
if needed

11
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:35,340
I can lend you some thanks

12
00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:36,340
But no need

13
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:39,340
There are many poor students like me in the university

14
00:00:39,340 --> 00:00:43,160
As long as they can complete their training

15
00:00:43,160 --> 00:00:44,160
Then I can definitely do it

16
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:54,250
Teacher Hu

17
00:00:54,250 --> 00:00:58,760
What kind of injury is a real injury?

18
00:00:58,760 --> 00:01:02,100
I hope

19
00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:04,290
Don't ever get hurt in your life
